                <head>Agreement between the United States and Canada on reconversion of industry;
                    cooperation in transition from war to peace</head>
                <p>[Effected by exchange of notes signed at Ottawa May 7 and 15, 1945. For text, see
                    Department of State Treaties and Other International Acts Series No. 1752. The
                    Agreement was one continuing the principles of the Hyde Park Declaration of
                    April 20, 1941, printed in Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bulletin</hi>, April 26, 1941, p. 494.] </p>
            </div>
